From 4406dd2fbc9af0b5c5c36560b587b00f5e4bede3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR-Vensuki <260785366+LR-Vensuki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:16:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] glsl-to-cxx: WebRender's fragment shaders in GLSL ES 1.0 for
 OpenGL ES 2

The 9_3 translator writes a second dialect for GPUs such as the PowerVR
SGX of A4-A6 iOS devices: GLSL ES spelling, integer common functions
through floats, arrays copied element by element, vector conditions
through mix. swgl's build embeds the source on iOS (or with SWGL_ESSL=1).
All 71 GPU variants compile and link on an iPhone 4S; ps_text_run's
variants still fail in glsl-to-cxx and stay on the CPU.
